The documentation, README, and metadata files in this repository describe the
publicly available service at https://tools.idigitrust.com/ and its MCP endpoint.
You may link to, quote, and reference these materials for the purpose of
integrating with or cataloguing the service (including MCP registries and
directories).

Redistribution of the full contents of this repository requires attribution
("IDigiTrust SSL Toolkit" with a link to https://tools.idigitrust.com/).

The service itself is provided free of charge, without registration:
- Private keys processed by the service are handled in memory only and are
  never stored or logged.
- The API is rate-limited per IP address; see the site for current limits.

